  "details": "Hello, the new camera orientation is an interesting new feature in the open beta. However, I have a hard time putting the camera horizontally in flight mode like it always worked before.\n\nI also use  the camera as a secondary view. Now I have to fight with the orientation to keep it how I want it to be.\n\nTo put it simply, it's much harder for me to use the camera now.\n\n> Can you add an option to disable camera orientation, like it worked before the beta ?",
